notes.content:
Hello everyone! 

Thanks to everyone who played the demo and sent feedback. It's very valuable for our team and helps us refine and improve the game. 

We have prepared a small update, which includes:
[list]
[*] New “Fever” mode, where you have to complete the demo in a certain amount of time;
[*] Fixing several bugs; 
[*] Additional optimization;
[*] Fixing the collision of the dash strike;
[*] New dialogues;
[*] And a couple of Easter eggs. 
[/list]
Play and share your impressions here or on [url=https://discord.gg/ZhjKSKRFrh]Discord[/url]. 

Love,
HEART ABYSS Team

Hello everyone! 

The big day has finally come! Today, we're unveiling a brand-new demo for Heart Abyss, which features absolutely ALL the changes we've made over the last few months.

[previewyoutube=5T-rScfdAUI;full][/previewyoutube]

[list]
[*] The Prologue;
[*] Two levels: the "Dungeons" and "Masta's Mansion"
[*] The first boss, Kazuo Iwamoto;
[*] New enemies: Shadow Warriors, and a Warrior with a Naginata, Hammerman;
[*] The execution and healing systems;
[*] More gameplay features: sword-throwing sight, electricity mechanics, arena system;
[*] A new beginning to the story;
[*] Updated graphics on all levels!
[/list] 
Download the latest demo update, today! We look forward to your feedback here or on [url=https://discord.gg/ZhjKSKRFrh]Discord[/url]. 

We are already working on the next levels. Thank you for your support and faith in the team and the project! 

Love,
HEART ABYSS Team
